        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kula ilagho jawuyabonywa ni wandu wa Israeli kufuma luma lwa nakesho hata nakenyi ni ja duu jenona. Wachuria kukaia wa mikalo na mabonyo ghetumia ndighi, wabonya mapatano na kubonya biashara na Misri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA oko na mashitakio aighu ya wandu wa Juda, nao uchawikaba wandu wa Israeli kunughana na chia rawo, na kuwilipa kara kara na mabonyo ghawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji wawae Jakobo orekoghe kifunyi orewadieghe ghimbe ya mruna, na iji orewurieghe mundu m'baa, oresimaneghe na Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 25.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.24+GEN.32.25+GEN.32.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 32.24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oresimaneghe na malaika ukasima, ukalila ukighulola wughoma ghwake; ukakwana na Mlungu aja Betheli, na ajaeni Mlungu ukaghora nao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.10+GEN.28.11+GEN.28.12+GEN.28.13+GEN.28.14+GEN.28.15+GEN.28.16+GEN.28.17+GEN.28.18+GEN.28.19+GEN.28.20+GEN.28.21+GEN.28.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 28.10-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu, Uo-Uwadie-Ndighi-Rose, irina jake ni BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo idana inyo kivalwa cha Jakobo, muwuye kwa Mlungu onyu; mumrumirie na kukuzaisira lukundo na hachi, mummbeserie Mlungu onyu kwa kurumaghia upate kum'bonyera hachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu kuchuria kutanya Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Wandu wa Israeli weesowa wuloli sa Wakanaani; weekunda kukalia wandu wawo na vipimo va tee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadaghamba, ‘Aa, dameria kuwuya wazuri wa mali, damerie kukupatira wuzuri; ndekuwadie mndungi udimagha kudishitakia wei deepata mali kuseko na hachi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ini BWANA Mlungu wako nerekulongozereghe kufuma Misri, nichakubonya kukaie hemenyi sena iji nerekukueghe aho kireti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.42+LEV.23.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wal. 23.42-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nadedanye na walodi; ngawineka mafunuo mengi. Naonyere wandu wapo kwa mifwano ngiwitumia walodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena milimu yaawuyataswa aho Gileadi, na awo wiitasagha wichafwa. Njau raawuyabwaghwa rikaie vizongona aho Gilgali, na madhabahu rawo wori richanoneka putu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo orekimbirieghe cha isanga ja Mesopotamia; aho ukabonya wudumiki gholisha ng'ondi kwa wundu ghopata muka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.29.1+GEN.29.2+GEN.29.3+GEN.29.4+GEN.29.5+GEN.29.6+GEN.29.7+GEN.29.8+GEN.29.9+GEN.29.10+GEN.29.11+GEN.29.12+GEN.29.13+GEN.29.14+GEN.29.15+GEN.29.16+GEN.29.17+GEN.29.18+GEN.29.19+GEN.29.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 29.1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA oremdumieghe mlodi kuwifunya wandu wa Israeli isanga ja Misri; kwa chia ya uo mlodi, wikalindilwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.50+EXO.12.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 12.50-51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Israeli wamvavirie BWANA nandighi, hata eewifwana wifo kwa makosa ghawo. BWANA uchawikaba kwa wundu ghwa masholio upatire kwa wundu ghwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
